keywords:
  - input-output economics
  - pytorch
  - forecasting
  - reproducible research
abstract: >-
  Local-first economic research terminal. One loopback process serves cached
  World Bank and OECD observations, hypothetical production-network scenarios,
  and saved PyTorch checkpoints. Held-out evaluations are reported with
  baselines. On the committed 2022 graph test, ridge has the lowest RMSE. The
  GRU checkpoints do not beat ridge on every seed.
